Ueventd applies the hda-audio recipe's narrow card-ID label when the MSI's analog HDA card
appears, so the selector can rename it. Drop together with the MSI audio selector.

--- a/etc/ueventd.rc
+++ b/etc/ueventd.rc
@@ -166,3 +166,6 @@
 /dev/mtd* 0664 system system
 /proc/mtd 0444 system ap_firmware
 /dev/nvram 0664 system system
+
+# Apply the narrow card-ID label when the MSI's analog HDA card appears.
+/sys/devices/pci0000:00/0000:00:08.1/0000:03:00.6/sound/card* id 0644 root root
